abstract: >-
  A local research platform comparing Mushroom Body-inspired sparse alert
  representations with conventional feature-space baselines, with a separate
  real-connectome exploration and abstract graph-diffusion viewer.
keywords:
  - cybersecurity
  - sparse representations
  - connectomics
  - reproducible research
